{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/m90b6t0r","slide":10,"title":"However, EU rules turn healthcare ML into a governed clinical process","textShapes":4}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xc3mho32","slide":10,"name":"object 2","placeholder":"title","text":"However, EU rules turn healthcare ML into a governed clinical process","textPreview":"However, EU rules turn healthcare ML into a governed clinical process","textChars":69,"textLines":1,"bbox":[101.95,28.65,1095.4,99.6]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/zelojyl8","slide":10,"name":"object 4","bbox":[458.88,171.88,33.6,412]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ydcnatkn","slide":10,"name":"object 5","bbox":[787.2,146.92,52.8,461.93]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/l036l83y","slide":10,"name":"object 6","bbox":[104.64,193.97,354.27,368.73]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzu5c32t","slide":10,"name":"object 7","text":"\nEU AI Act\nHigh-risk clinical decision support requires risk management, transparency, human oversight and record-keeping.\n\nGDPR Article 22\nPeople affected by semi-automated decisions need meaningful information and safeguards.\n\nEuropean Health Data Space\nRegistry data can support secondary use—but only through governed access and permitted purposes.","textPreview":"| EU AI Act | High-risk clinical decision support requires risk management, transparency, human oversight and record-keeping. |  | GDPR A...","textChars":352,"textLines":9,"bbox":[0,0,0,0]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/725onyl4","slide":10,"name":"object 8","text":"\nImpact on care delivery\nHuman oversight, transparency and an auditable decision become part of the clinical workflow.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nImpact on model delivery\nEvidence, permissions and data lineage must remain clear from training through clinical use.","textPreview":"| Impact on care delivery | Human oversight, transparency and an auditable decision become part of the clinical workflow. |  |  |  |  |  ...","textChars":243,"textLines":12,"bbox":[492.48,171.88,294.73,412]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/m1cnetkj","slide":10,"name":"object 9","bbox":[123.84,229.49,37.47,260.27]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/s7yt4b21","slide":10,"name":"object 10","text":"\n\nREQUIRED DEVELOPMENT ACTIONS\n\nMake decisions explainable\nUse an interpretable model, document intended use and limits, and provide a patient-level explanation.\n\n\nValidate and retain oversight\nTest calibration and performance; define human\nreview and record the final clinical decision.\n\n\nGovern data and traceability\nEnforce permissions; version data and models; retain reconstructable inputs, logs and monitoring.","textPreview":"|  | REQUIRED DEVELOPMENT ACTIONS |  | Make decisions explainable | Use an interpretable model, document intended use and limits, and pro...","textChars":416,"textLines":15,"bbox":[840,146.91,336,461.93]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/m90b6t0r","slide":10,"text":""}
