{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a543mx4r","slide":12,"name":"object 9","text":"Regulators & governance\nNeed auditable lineage, versioning, monitoring and a recorded human decision for every use.","textPreview":"Regulators & governance | Need auditable lineage, versioning, monitoring and a recorded human decision for every use.","textChars":115,"textLines":2,"bbox":[149.16,192.38,241.87,92.6]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wvupgz6t","slide":12,"name":"object 10","text":"Clinicians\nNeed an interpretable, calibrated score in an approved workflow—while retaining final accountability.","textPreview":"Clinicians | Need an interpretable, calibrated score in an approved workflow—while retaining final accountability.","textChars":112,"textLines":2,"bbox":[103.21,420.48,246.2,92.73]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xw3q94ne","slide":12,"name":"object 11","text":"Patients\nNeed a clear explanation of the score, its uncertainty and how it influenced—or can be challenged in—care.","textPreview":"Patients | Need a clear explanation of the score, its uncertainty and how it influenced—or can be challenged in—care.","textChars":115,"textLines":2,"bbox":[926.23,294.69,248.87,92.53]}
