{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gbedwfmx","slide":17,"name":"object 3","text":"The Oxford Knee Score runs \t0–48. A 2-point rise is real \tarithmetic and no change the \tpatient can feel.\n\nThe minimal clinically \timportant difference — the \tsmallest change a patient \tnotices — is around 7 points.\n\nThe target is anchored to that,","textPreview":"The Oxford Knee Score runs \t0–48. A 2-point rise is real \tarithmetic and no change the \tpatient can feel. |  | The minimal clinically \tim...","textChars":248,"textLines":5,"bbox":[85.83,208.55,525.13,505.4]}
