{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vitkzqlc","slide":26,"name":"object 3","text":"1. The ML experiment item — one parent run per training \tsession, one child run per model. Collapse to compare sessions, \texpand to compare models.\n2. Filter the run list by tag: interpretability = blackbox. That is the \tdeployment gate, as a query.\n3. The registered ML model item — versions, and the tags that \ttravelled with each one.\n4. gold_table_version on the shipped run → the Delta version it \twas trained on.\n5. SELECT * FROM gold.knee_features VERSION AS OF <n>\n— the training input, reconstructed live.","textPreview":"1. The ML experiment item — one parent run per training \tsession, one child run per model. Collapse to compare sessions, \texpand to compa...","textChars":514,"textLines":6,"bbox":[85.83,176.47,1093.8,505.4]}
